{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33935","headline":"奉和鲁望独夜有怀吴体见寄 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望独夜有怀吴体见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病鹤带雾傍独屋，破巢含雪倾孤梧。\n濯足将加汉光腹，抵掌欲捋梁武须。\n隐几清吟谁敢敌，枕琴高卧真堪图。\n此时枉欠高散物，楠瘤作樽石作垆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33935.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33935","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}